sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Seller
  participant API as Marketplace API
  participant Fabric as Chaincode
  participant DB as Mongo projection
  participant Buyer

  Seller->>API: POST listing terms
  Note right of API: Validate seller, battery, kWh and price
  API->>Fabric: CreateListing(listingId, terms)
  Fabric-->>API: Confirmed active listing
  API->>DB: Store confirmed projection
  API-->>Seller: Created listing

  Buyer->>API: GET available listings
  API->>Fabric: ReadListings(active)
  Fabric-->>API: Active listing records
  API-->>Buyer: Available listings

  Seller->>API: POST cancel listing
  Note right of API: Fabric rejects cancellation while an active token reservation exists
  API->>Fabric: CancelListing(listingId, authenticatedSellerId)
  Fabric-->>API: Confirmed cancellation
  API->>DB: Update projection after confirmation
  API-->>Seller: Cancelled listing
